  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Torre de S. Garc\u00eda near Algeciras</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Albus Portus is attested on the Antonine Itinerary and refers to a mansio located between Carteia and Mellaria. Modern scholarship places it at the site of the now-demolished 16th-century Torre de San Garc\u00eda at modern Algeciras in Spain.",
